## The game's icon set. Owner: U.
##
## Exp 006 (U): a coherent pixel / voxel-style set. Every icon is a 12 x 12
## bitmap (PIXELS: '#' the colour, '+' its shade, '*' a highlight, '.' empty)
## painted as crisp rectangles, so it matches the Pixel Operator font and the
## voxel world. Pixel-perfect at 12, 24 and 36 px; other sizes snap each cell
## to whole pixels. The Experiment 002 vector glyphs stay as the fallback for
## any kind without a bitmap.
##   UiIcons.paint(canvas_item, "moon", Rect2(0, 0, 24, 24), UiTheme.TEXT)
##   button.icon = UiIcons.texture("hammer", 24)      # white; tint with modulate
